__1. to make proof of (Hom.).
__2. to try, attempt (Luc., Polyb., with inf. (see M, Pr., 205; B1., § 69, 4), Act.9:26 16:7 24:6.
__3. In LXX and NT, like Heb. נָסָה, with accusative of person(s), to test, try, prove;
__(a) in a good sense : Jhn.6:6, 2Co.13:5, Heb.11:17, Rev.2:2; esp. of trials and af6ictions sent or permitted by God (Gen.22:1, Exo.20:20, Wis.3:5, al.), 1Co.10:13, Heb.2:18 4:15 11:17, 37, Rev.3:10;
__(b) in a bad sense (Apoll. Rhod., 3, 10): of the attempts made to ensnare Jesus in his speech, Mat.16:1 19:3 22:18, 35 Mrk.8:11 10:2 12:15, Luk.11:16, Jhn.8:6; of temptation to sin, to tempt, Jas.1:13-14 (see Hort, in l), Gal.6:1, Rev.2:10; esp. of temptations of the devil, Mat.4:1, 3 Mrk.1:13, Luk.4:2, 1Co.7:5, 1Th.3:5; ὁ πειράζων, the tempter, Mat.4:3, 1Th.3:5;
__(with) in bad sense also (Exo.17:2, 7, Num.14:22, al.), of distrustful testing, trying or challenging of God: Act.15:10, 1Co.10:9 (WH, mg., ἐξεπείρασαν), Heb.3:9; τ. πνεῦμα Κυρίου, Act.5:9 (of. ἐκ-πειράζω).†
SYN.: δοκιμάζω, q.v (AS)

he.fuller:
πειράζω poët. and late prose form of πειράω, ר׳ ערך,
[בשבעים for נָסָה פיעל ;]
1. to make proof of (Hom.).
2. to try, attempt (Luc., Polyb., עם מקור (see M, Pr., 205; B1., § 69, 4), מע״ש.9:26 16:7 24:6.
3. בשבעים and ברה״ח, like עב׳ נָסָה, עם ישי׳ של אדם, to test, try, prove;
(a) in a good sense : יוחנן.6:6, 2קור.13:5, עב.11:17, התג.2:2; במיוחד of trials and af6ictions sent or permitted by God (בר.22:1, שמ.20:20, חכמ.3:5, ועוד), 1קור.10:13, עב.2:18 4:15 11:17, 37, התג.3:10;
(b) in a bad sense (Apoll. Rhod., 3, 10): of the attempts made to ensnare Jesus in his speech, מתי.16:1 19:3 22:18, 35 מרקוס.8:11 10:2 12:15, לוקס.11:16, יוחנן.8:6; of temptation to sin, to tempt, יעק.1:13-14 (ר׳ Hort, in l), גל.6:1, התג.2:10; במיוחד of temptations of the devil, מתי.4:1, 3 Mrk.1:13, לוקס.4:2, 1קור.7:5, 1תס.3:5; ὁ πειράζων, the tempter, מתי.4:3, 1תס.3:5;
(with) in bad sense also (שמ.17:2, 7, במ.14:22, ועוד), of distrustful testing, trying or challenging of God: מע״ש.15:10, 1קור.10:9 (WH, mg., ἐξεπείρασαν), עב.3:9; τ. πνεῦμα Κυρίου, מע״ש.5:9 (of. ἐκ-πειράζω).†
נרדף: δοκιμάζω, q.v (AS)

en.fuller:
πέμπω
[in LXX chiefly for שָׁלַח ;]
to send;
__(a) of persons: with accusative, absol., Mat.22:7, Luk.7:19, Jhn.1:22, 2Co.9:3, al.; ptcp. before verb., Mat.14:10, Act.19:31, al.; ptcp. before διά (= Heb. יָד;, 1Ki.16:20, al.), Mat.11:2 (cf. Rev.1:1); of teachers sent by God, Jhn.1:33 4:34, Rom.8:3, al.; with accusative and dative, 1Co.4:17, Php.2:19; before πρός, with accusative, Luk.4:26, Jhn.16:7, al.; before λέγων (cf. Heb. אָמַר שָׁלַח Gen.38:25, al.), Luk.7:6, 19; before εἰς, with accusative loc., Mat.2:8, Luk.15:15, al.; before εἰς (of purpose), Eph.6:22, Col.4:8, 1Pe.2:14; with inf., Jhn.1:33, 1Co.16:3, Rev.22:16;
__(b) of things : Rev.11:10; before εἰς, Rev.1:11; id., of purpose, Act.11:29, Php.4:16; with dative of person(s), 2Th.2:11; π. τ. δρέπανον σου (cf. εξαποστείλατε δρέπανα = מַגָּל שָׁלַח, Jol.3:13), Rev.14:15, 18 (cf. ἀνα-, ἐκ-, μετα-, προ-, συν-πέμπω)
SYN.: ἀποστέλλω, q.v (AS)

es.fuller:
